# Normalización de fin de línea.
#
# Windows development, Linux deployment, and a shell script in the repository.
# Without this, every checkout rewrites the whole tree's line endings and the
# diff is noise that hides real changes.
#
#   * text=auto  - git decides, and normalises to LF in the repository
#   *.bat, *.sh - must stay CRLF, or Windows cannot run them

* text=auto

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
